  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">여러가지 힘 전시장 수업 모습 올려드려요. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">전 수업시간을 3년째 전시장 수업형태로 하고 있는데 너무 딱 좋아요. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">아이들이 수업을 준비하고 실험을 할 수 있도록 안내하는 것이 중요해요. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">이 방법은 처음에는 좀 힘들지만 나중에는 아이들이 준비하고 서로 설명하고 나누면서 열심히 배우게 되더라구요. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">선생님도 편하고 아이들도 많이 배우는 것을 느낄 수 있어요.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">다음주까지 진도 나가고 있습니다. 보시고 싶은 분은 시간표 변경해서 저희 학교 구경오셔도 되요. ㅎ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">다음은 4차시 발표 모습입니다. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">발표요령은 첫번째 힘의 정의, 힘과 관련된 요소(방향, 힘의 크기 등), 힘을 이용한 실생활의 예, 장남감 만들기 등으로...</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(1) 1</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">차시 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">전체 단원 살펴보기 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">선생님과 함께</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(2) 2</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">차시 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">각 모둠별로 발표자료 만들기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); font-size: 10pt;\">(3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">차시 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: 1-3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">모둠이 부스 운영</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, 4-6</span><span style=\"color: rgb(71, 71, 71); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">모둠이 로테이션 식으로 각 실험 후 탐구지 작성</span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(4) 4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">차시 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: 4-6</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">모둠이 부스 운영</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">, 1-3</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">모둠이 로테이션 식으로 각 실험 후 탐구지 작성</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">(5) 5</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">차시 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양신명조;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;\">전시장 내용을 함께 정리( 중력, 탄성력</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;\">)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">(6) 6차시 : 전시장내용정리(마찰력, 부력)</span></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><br></span></p></span></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-