pleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><br></span></span></span></span><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9944CA4C5CDF577B2C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"768\" data-filename=\"20190509_092837.jpg\" exif=\"{}\"  id=\"A_9944CA4C5CDF577B2CDF89\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\">2,5조 : 마찰력실험장치, 사포, 용수철저울, 막대, 비닐봉지 등</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 20pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"lett